{"Time":"2026-10-06T06:50:04.7799501+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04CurrentA01","Output":"材料次数为0。\\nContextBundle包含原始记录引用及快照hash，能回查每个引用。\\n正常分支复核bundle revision/hash并运行；必需上下文缺失时阻塞受影响调用，不以记忆fail-open继续；可选召回失败只降低覆盖。\\n两端core_build_id/协议/配置/输入版本一致；同一会话最多一个有效写入owner，重复命令重放原回执；事件、工具结果、费用及产物hash收敛，不能各自启动一个写同一会话的Agent。 W06只证明协议与共享核心，真实Desktop体验和双端接续仍待P03/P06，不提前记为产品UI已通过。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C02\",\"command_key\":\"test.security\",\"expected\":\"所有A的响应/日志/ContextBundle不含B的秘密标记；越权请求不返回B正文。\\n通用知识可读且保留来源、授权范围、版本；共享不扩大为B全项目权限。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable"}
{"Time":"2026-10-06T06:50:04.7799501+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04CurrentA01","Output":"_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C03\",\"command_key\":\"test.domain\",\"expected\":\"T1为NEEDS_REVALIDATION，A1为STALE；集合恰为两个受影响对象。\\nT2可继续且不因本次变更进入NEEDS_REVALIDATION。\\n旧结果可封存为历史，但不能成为current或ACCEPTED；过期If-Match写入返回412，状态不兼容提交返回409。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C04\",\"command_key\":\"test.context\",\"expected\":\"只有一个同revision写入成功；另一请求412且不覆盖；整合后恰有一个当前生效决定。\\n相同事件ID最多产生一次业务副作用；缺前序事件先补取/等待，不倒退状态。\\n相同幂等键/相同请求重放原结果；同键不同请求返回409。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C05\",\"command_key\":\"test.experimen"}
